Addendum: TRAITOROUS BOX!</p>
<p>So why was it keter? What did/does it do? Why is it safe/neutralized now that it's stuck in the middle of a plastic cube? There's so little information here about why I should be scared of it that I'm more confused than anything else.</p>
</blockquote>
